Fri Jan 15 11:37:22 UTC 2016 - aloisio@gmx.com

- Update to version 0.2.0
  * Fixed installation of shared library symlink.
  * Switched LFE channel interpolation to FIR filter by default.
  * Added command line option and context flag to select IIR
    filter for LFE channel interpolation.
  * Fixed two bugs that could cause decoder to crash when
    processing invalid input.
  * Fixed handling of sync loss when decoding MA streams with
    multiple frequency bands.
  * Fixed decoding of MA streams with multiple frequency bands
    when sampling frequency of the first band is not 96 kHz.
  * Fixed decoding to standard output on Windows causing junk
    to be appended after normal PCM data.

